              )
          %p
            More generally, there is a “
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/magic+pyramid"}> magic pyramid
            ” of super-
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Einstein-Yang-Mills+theories"} Einstein-Yang-Mills theories
            and their U-duality groups.
          %h2#properties Properties
          %h3#relation_to_tduality_and_sduality Relation to T-duality and S-duality
          %p
            U-duality may be understood as being the combination of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/T-duality"} T-duality
            for the compactification torus and
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/S-duality"} S-duality
            of
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/type+IIB+superstring+theory"} type IIB superstring theory
            = succeed ")." do
              %a{:href => "#West12"} West 12, section 17.5.4
